    "Entries are unstandardized OLS coefficients with city-clustered standard errors in parentheses." ///
    "Within each outcome, R1-R4 use exactly the same linked respondents aged 16-65 in 2025. Every retained person answered the 2023 AI module, and no household contributes more than one record." ///
    "R1 contains the corresponding 2022 outcome and structural position measured in 2023; R2 adds 2023 devices; R3 adds AI awareness; R4 adds AI familiarity and prior use." ///
    "Phone and computer measures are from 2023; no 2025 device measures are used." ///
    "Respondents routed out of familiarity and use because they were unaware of AI are retained. Genuine missing follow-up responses remain missing." ///
    "The coefficients represent prospective conditional associations and should not be interpreted as causal effects."

