    `common_notes'                                       ///
    "The dependent variable is IHS total reported individual income in 2024. The sample is restricted to continuously employed respondents with valid income in both waves." ///
    "All models additionally include 2023 industry indicators, which are not displayed, and use the configured 2025 `ai_analysis_weight' survey weight."

