    "The dependent variables are the 2024 value minus the corresponding 2022 value. The baseline value of the same outcome is intentionally omitted; otherwise the exposure coefficient is algebraically equivalent to the main lagged-outcome model." ///
    "All models include 2023 demographic, socioeconomic and geographic controls, 2023 devices, AI awareness, AI familiarity and prior AI use. The individual-income and working-time models also include 2023 industry indicators." ///
    "Samples are identical to the corresponding main outcome models and the estimates remain associational rather than causal."


